Few-Short Propmting
-------------------
Classify the following movie reviews as Positive or Negative.
 Follow the examples. Example 1: "I loved this movie!" → Positive 
Example 2: "It was boring and dull." → Negative 
Example 3: "Great acting and story!" → Positive 

Now classify: "The movie was too long and not interesting."

